WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.820
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.610
I'm a sixth grader,
who's also an entertainer.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.950
My Aoki Laureate novelist Mama.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan...

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.950
Hayama Akito. The reason
for his grouchiness is...

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.880
...these Chicken-and-egg dum-dums.
How did that turn out?

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:53.130
This is your fault, Akito!
Everything is your fault!

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.630
You're the one who killed Mother,
after all!

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:56.300
You're the devil!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.640
You demon child! If only
you had never been born...!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.850
It hurts to be told that,
even when we're acting, Hayama.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.600
And you've been through that
for 11 whole years...

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.390
You call others devil this,
and devil that,

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.940
but what about yourselves?
You dummy father-and-daughter...

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.270
Mama,

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.230
why did you have me?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:20.280
Mama loves you, Mika. I've loved you
since before you were born. That's why...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:26.580
...I worked so hard to give birth to you.
It made me happy to have you, Mika.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.620
Father...

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.630
I've... been awful to Akito,
quite truthfully.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.800
A-chan, about your Mama...

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.140
I love you, A-chan, and that's
why I tried so hard to have you.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.180
And so, for Mama's sake...

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.600
keep at it, and go on living,
okay, A-chan?

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.520
Mr. Hayama?

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.980
I'm sorry.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.910
Sana-chan...

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:05.240
Your drama... was good.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.330
His father's back was so big,

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.130
it made Hayama look small,
which was kind of funny.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.500
Oh, by the way, this fine man
with the sunglasses is my manager,

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.260
as well as my pimp and boyfriend, Rei-kun!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.130
And this is my favorite actress,
Kurumi Asako-san.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.180
And this episode seems to be one
that develops her some more!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:31.190
"Kurumi and the Wound-Up Love Rivalry"

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.900
I'm home!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.570
Oh, I'm so tired!

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:41.900
Judging by your tone, I'm guessing things
went pretty well with the Hayama family.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.740
But of chorus!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.240
I probably wouldn't
say it went that well,

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.910
but at least for now, things should
be a little better for him.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:50.910
Really?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.250
Huh?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.580
Huh? Where's Rei-kun?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.000
He said he had a slight
headache or something,

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.420
and that he was retiring early.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.010
Geez, I have to sleep alone tonight!?

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.590
And here, I especially
wanted to hear Rei-kun...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.590
Nice going, Sana-chan.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.260
...tell me how well I've done.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.700
Did I...?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.950
Are you awake?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:30.950
Mm-hmm.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.130
Your fever has fallen quite a bit, too.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.760
I'm sorry.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.890
Sana-chan... wasn't it?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.940
She called us
"Chicken-and-egg dum-dums."

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.560
C- chicken-and-egg dum-dums?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.610
Chicken-and-egg dum-dums.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.610
Chicken-and-egg dum-dums...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.570
She said we were
chicken-and-egg dum-dums.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.330
"Chicken-and-egg dum-dums"

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.620
Watching her drama last night
made me think about some things.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.830
I videotaped it, so later,
you should watch it too.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.300
Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.260
Here, Akito! Hot! Hot! I made...
Hot! Hot! ...some porridge for you.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:31.890
Hot! Hot!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.560
Porridge, for me?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.060
That's right. Hot! It's the
first time I've ever made any.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.230
Hot! So I can't make any guarantees
about the flavor. Hot! Hot!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.560
Yeah, I know.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.230
What do you mean by that!?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:43.940
Oh no, I'm going to be late for school!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.900
Ah, and Father...

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.660
You'd better get some sleep, too.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.830
You didn't get much sleep
at all last night, did you? Bye!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.580
You didn't sleep?

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.250
Don't worry about it.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.250
Now then, Dad's going to go off to work.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.260
You stay home and lie down.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.170
Uh-huh.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.600
One other thing, Akito... Dad's going
to come home as early as possible.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.560
From now on, you'll eat dinner at home.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.690
I told your sister to make
something every night.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:23.900
By the way, I hear tonight,
we're having chicken-and-egg over rice.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.280
Do you mind?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.660
Not particularly.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.910
Dad doesn't
particularly mind, either. Bye.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:43.250
It feels like we just had
quite a conversation...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.510
That was probably... a first...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.680
And then! And then!
His dad picked him up!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.890
Hayama almost looked
like he was a child!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.970
Of course, he is a child...

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.270
But anyway, it was like...
it was like... it was like...

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.230
you know what I mean?
Yeah? You know what I mean?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:05.070
I know. It was worth drinking your
Supopotamin and working so hard, Sana-chan.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.400
Mm-hmm. A family has to
get along with itself, huh?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.360
They really are parents
and their children, after all.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.570
Here, your usual.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.570
It's your allowance.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.910
I'm feeling so good right now,
I'm going to be especially generous!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.580
Thank you so much.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.040
In exchange, you're not
getting away tonight.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.250
After all, Rei-kun, last night,
you went to bed ahead of me!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.920
I had a headache...

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.260
That's right. Do you have a fever?
Could it be a cold?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.590
S- Sana-chan...!

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.220
I can't see in front of me!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.890
Hmm, you don't seem to have a fever...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.220
W- watch out! Watch out!
Watch out, I say!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.350
No fever! No fever! No fever, I say!
You've got to fight to get over that cold!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.640
Are you listening, Hayama!?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.070
"Did you hear that, Hayama?"

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.900
Mama, why did you have me?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.900
Mika...

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:56.910
Mama loves you, Mika. I've loved you
since before you were born. That's why...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.910
...I worked so hard to give birth
to you. It made me happy to have you.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.750
A-chan, about your Mama...

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:14.590
I love you, A-chan, and that's
why I tried so hard to have you.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:18.930
And so, for Mama's sake,
keep at it, and go on living, okay?

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.930
For whiter teeth to die for,
Hamigakin X!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.850
Even better when your
whole family uses it!

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.980
No! Mother, don't die!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.820
For whiter teeth to die for--

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.200
Don't die!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.200
For whiter teeth--

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.210
Oh, no! We're late!
We're late! We're late!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.840
Today, before you tape
"Child's Toy,"

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.010
you've got a toothpaste
commercial to shoot!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.890
What!?

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.640
That was mean! Rei-kun,
don't stop so suddenly!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.900
He's gone...!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:06.900
Why?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.570
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.900
Are you okay, Sana-chan?

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.900
Ah, Asako-san!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.910
G- good morning!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:17.910
What are you up to?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.910
Eh, um, here! Here! The tips
of these bristles are so firm!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.250
And what's more, there's
this laminated tube, you see?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.920
That's not what she was asking.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.920
Oh, right, Sana-chan, I suppose
that interview is out, isn't it?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.210
Huh? Interview?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.970
You haven't heard? I have an assignment
to do an interview for a magazine,

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.890
and I'd like very much to
do it with you, Sana-chan.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.470
With me!?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:46.390
I had the editorial staff contact you

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:49.230
about whether or not you
had to work this Saturday.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:53.900
That's strange. I wonder why Rei-kun
turned that down. My Saturday is free.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.200
So, will you do it?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.820
I want to do this with you,
Sana-chan, no matter what!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.240
I- I'll do it! By all means,
let me do it!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:07.250
Ah, but are you sure it's okay
to do it with a child like me?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.250
If you'll be kind enough to
entertain a grown-up like me.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.130
Sure!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.590
You're going to be interviewed
by Kurumi Asako!?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.880
That's right! Asako-san picked me out!

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.260
Incredible!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.970
She sure is nice!
There's an air about her.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.100
Ah, Hayama!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.940
Hey there, it's been three days.
You're over your cold. That's great.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.020
Oh, right. Here, here...

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:37.360
You don't have to panic,
I meant to give it to you.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.660
I get the feeling that things
will be okay now without it.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.530
--You're sure?
--Mm-hmm!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.830
Now, you no longer have anything on me.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.220
--Hayama-san...
--He's being overpowered!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.890
Don't go around hitting things,
just because you're upset, A-chan.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.850
Well, I guess devils don't
turn into angels overnight.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.360
Hayama-san, what's this picture?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.240
I- I'm sorry!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.820
We didn't see anything! Not a thing!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.160
Still, little by little...

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.330
"Basking in the sun at noon recess!"

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:37.920
Akito-kun, I heard you
talked with your father.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.220
More or less.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.600
Sana-chan, are you leaving early?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.390
I forgot that I had work!
Farewell, my friends!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.600
Friends, huh?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.270
Do you like her?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.940
Mm-hmm, I like Sana-chan.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.940
You're sure that's okay, what with him?

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.950
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.950
He's Sana-chan's manager.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.280
She says he's her pimp.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:09.580
H- he can't be. He can't be, that's--
that just isn't...!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.960
No!!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.920
Do you know what it means to be a pimp?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.960
What is a pimp?

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.300
At any rate,

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.390
it means, "watch yourself."

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.310
This week's Sana-chan.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:34.230
Sensei, you're the guest
today on "Laugh Away," right?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.560
Uh-huh.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.980
I'm thinking of going on
with this headpiece.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.190
I think it's fine,
whichever one you go with.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.240
Well, I'll be taking you down
to Studio Marta, then...

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.570
That's okay.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.240
Tomorrow is the day Sana-chan has
that interview. Take her there.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.910
No, Sensei, your engagement
is more important...

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:53.910
By any chance, do you not want to go to
this interview!? That's it, isn't it!?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.870
N- no, that's not...

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.750
Then you must want to meet Tamorin!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.590
But you can't.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.590
Even if I were to allow it...

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:06.930
Rei-kun!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.930
Let's go to bed early! Tomorrow,
we have that interview with Asako-san!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.270
You see?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.810
Very well.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:22.530
Rei-kun... I love you.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:35.250
Bad news! Bad news! Rei-kun is...!
Rei-kun is...! Rei-kun is...!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.250
Rei-kun is sick!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.850
What do I do!? What do I do!?
Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:57.850
My stomach...!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:59.900
It hurts! It hurts!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:04.860
Oh, what should I do!?
Rei-kun! What should I do!?

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.200
What's the matter, Sana?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.200
Rei-kun says his stomach hurts!
And that's making Rei-kun hurt, too!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.740
--And when Rei-kun's stomach hurts,
Rei-kun hurts!
--When that happens,

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.200
--His stomach is hurting him!
--you write the character
for "person" three times...

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.120
...and swallow it!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.540
There, that calmed you down, right?

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:24.210
I'm sorry, Sana-chan, I can't
drive the car like this.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.550
Could you go to your
interview today by yourself?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.550
That's fine, fine!
Don't even worry about it!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.810
Um, Sensei, you and Sana-chan
had better hurry along...

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.480
Now's not the time for that!
Ambulance! Ambulance!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.150
It won't do any good, Sana.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.810
W- what do you mean?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.150
I mean that even if the doctors see him,
they can't make him better.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:50.160
Y- you mean, in other words,
he's been possessed by an evil spirit!?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.120
Crazy mixed-up one-shot
fight Supopotamin!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.830
Evil spirit possessing Rei-kun,
come out at once!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.500
Not what I meant.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.830
If not that, then what?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:02.840
Don't tell me Rei-kun... is suffering
from some incurable illness!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.170
Under the weight of a waterfall,

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.840
I'll pray for Rei-kun to
have a complete recovery!!

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.170
And it's not that.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.510
Then what is it?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.510
Mama! Is it really that much fun
for you to tease your daughter!?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.850
You're the one who's let her
head explode, aren't you?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.980
You're the one who's letting
her head explode, Mama!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.520
How can you talk to
your mother like that!?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.150
How can you talk to
your daughter that way!?

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.190
S- stop that, please, both of you.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.190
B- but Rei-kun, your illness...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.610
W- well, actually...

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.780
You played sick!?

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.160
I'm sorry.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.450
See, Mom was saying he was
playing sick from the start.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.830
You never said it, though!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.830
So, never mind that, Rei-kun,
why would you play sick?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.710
Well, you see...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.510
Is it this late already!?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:53.550
We're going to be late for my interview
with Asako-san! Rei-kun, start the car!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.470
Come back soon.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:01.390
Sensei, it's your editor, Onda.
I've been staying overnight here

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.810
for the past three days,
waiting for your manuscript.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.690
I need to be taking it
back to the office soon,

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.190
or it won't be in time for printing--

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.860
You have it done, Sensei?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.820
Sensei, you're such a good person...

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.410
"Sorry"

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.200
I haven't done a thing.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.410
That stupid jerk...

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.750
Ah, Sana-chan, good morning!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.870
Asako-san!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:22.830
Over here, over here.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.540
I'm sorry I'm so late.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.210
That's okay. I'm glad you're here.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.880
Huh? Where is your manager?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.220
He said he was going to wait in the car,
so he's in the underground parking lot.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.800
Is that right? How grand
of you to come by yourself.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.800
It's really nothing much.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:41.140
Okay, Sana-chan, sit over here.
Let's start with some small talk.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.480
Okay.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.900
Yes, yes, your mother's
novels are amazing.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.820
I'm a fan of her's too.
She's amazing herself. There's her...

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.820
Her head, right?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.490
Yes.

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.030
She usually does her head up that way.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.160
Sometimes, if she does her hair regularly,
I wonder who she is.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.490
Sana-chan, you say some fairly
grown-up things for a child, don't you?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.830
Where did you learn how to do that?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.370
Let's see...
From what my mom says,

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.080
I'm just second-counting what
she says in her novels and stuff.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.500
Recounting?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.010
Yeah, that, that.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.180
And what do you call a bargain sale?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.180
Discounting!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.520
It really is enjoyable
speaking with you, Sana-chan.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.850
Is that so?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:31.860
U- um... Sana-chan, about your manager...

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.110
Ah, you mean Rei-kun?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:37.700
Mm-hmm. He has something of
a mysterious air about him,

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.780
and he is the subject of
rumors around the industry.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.080
They say he's living together
with his girlfriend.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.120
How true are those stories?

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.120
It's all true, actually.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.130
But...

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:54.130
You know what? He used to be a hermit.
But that's just between you and me.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.470
"That's just between you and me."

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:00.140
Oh, no! Editor-san, are you
putting that in the magazine!?

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:03.810
A hermit? Could you be more specific?

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:07.810
The fact is, you see, I found him
and picked him up in Shinjuku.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.150
I'm the sort who picks up
stray dogs, after all...

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.820
Anyhow, I made him my boyfriend!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.820
He had a beard,
and looked pretty haggard,

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.820
but I thought that if he worked
at it properly, he would look good.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.820
Feminine intuition...!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.620
...I guess you'd call it.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:27.540
J- just a moment.
I'm starting to get confused.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.500
How exactly did you mean, hermit?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.710
Well, he was what you'd
call a "Homeless-san."

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.630
He said that he had been
dumped by some awful woman,

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.140
and had had a terrible
string of misfortunes.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:44.560
All of his bad luck started as
a result of that woman, I hear.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.140
There sure are some
nasty women out there, huh?

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.480
Whoopsie, I might have
said too much there.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.810
Excuse me, please keep
that part off the record!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.150
Not a chance!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.150
Do something about it!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.820
It's already recorded!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.740
But... but...!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.820
"Work is finished!!"

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.820
Job well done!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.490
Oh, you were so adorable, Sana-chan!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.160
Once the manuscript is ready,
we'll send you a copy.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.370
Right. Thank you very much.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.500
Maybe I said a little too much.
Oh well...

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.500
Huh?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.510
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh...?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:19.470
Rei-kun... Where could
you have gone off to?

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.850
Rei...

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.270
Rei, it's you, isn't it!?

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:36.780
Wait, Rei!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.610
Asako-chan, where are you going!?

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:45.160
Come to think of it, Rei-kun didn't seem
to want to come to today's interview.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.790
He made up a fake
illness and everything...

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.410
I wonder why. Because of Asako-san?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.380
That's silly.

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:57.130
This is no time for that!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.880
Rei, where did you go?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.470
What's this? The post box is dancing!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.470
Rei!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.470
Hey, what's going on?

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.480
Wait! Rei!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.350
No answer, huh?

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.770
But then Rei-kun knew what time
I would be with Asako-san,

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.150
and went off someplace...

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:22.820
Now that I think about it,
that is a little weird, maybe...

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.490
The whole time we were
doing the drama, too.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.490
And then, Asako-san was asking...

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.490
Huh? Where is your manager?

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.830
Sana-chan, about your manager...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.460
It's a little unnatural for
Asako-san to have just chosen me

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.460
to interview in the first place,
isn't it?

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.420
Knowing her, she could have gotten
someone a lot bigger than me.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.260
Huh?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.260
Hu-uh?

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.590
Huh!?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.600
It couldn't be...

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.310
It couldn't be...!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.600
She's after Rei-kun!?

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.610
♪ It's the height of absurdity,
absurdity! ♪

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.610
♪ Even Kintaro, with his
axe on his shoulder, ♪

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.610
♪ was watchful around fires,
in case of emergency! ♪

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.610
♪ Emergencies come unexpectedly! ♪

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.280
♪ Times of emergency are coming! ♪

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.620
♪ Hey! Don't panic in an emergency, ♪

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.620
♪ calm yourself down,
and make a smiling face. ♪

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.620
♪ How about a nice cup of tea? ♪

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.960
♪ Have some snacks,
and we'll enjoy a nice talk. ♪

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.960
♪ Look right, look forward, look left, ♪

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.250
♪ if no cars are coming, we can cross! ♪

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.300
There's no time for this!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.630
Rei-kun!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:30.640
It's been a long time. You've been
avoiding me, haven't you? All this time...

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:36.140
I didn't see you once the whole time
we were shooting, after all.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.650
Um, could you be mistaking me
for someone else?

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.980
You can't play dumb with me!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.570
What's going on!?
Take off those sunglasses!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.360
Show me your face!

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.910
Rei-kun, where are you?

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.240
No... no... Rei-kun is...

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.000
...my boyfriend!

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:01.920
Rei... I've been looking for you,
all this time...

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.590
How can you say that,
after you dumped me?

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:04.590
It is you, Rei!

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:05.920
Uh, whoops...

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:08.470
I didn't dump you!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:10.600
You have the wrong person, I said!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.600
Hold on, now!

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.930
Show me your face!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.560
Take off those sunglasses!

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.230
Rei...

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:36.580
What are you doing to my Rei-kun!?

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.840
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.110
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:11.160
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.370
...panic!!

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:19.210
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:21.920
he's there.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:25.170
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.800
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.260
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:42.100
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:46.780
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:52.360
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:55.030
he's there,

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.200
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.330
...for two.
